OL,3,GNEWSASecond school placed in special
OL,4,Ameasures in county
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second school has been placed in
OL,7,Fspecial measures in a county in a span
OL,8,Fof two weeks.
OL,10,FOfsted said Berwick Academy in
OL,11,FNorthumberland was "failing to provide
OL,12,Fan acceptable standard of education" to
OL,13,Fits pupils and required urgent
OL,14,Fimprovement in six of the seven areas
OL,15,Fassessed.
OL,17,FThe result comes shortly after Cambois
OL,18,FPrimary School was found not to be
OL,19,Fmeeting safeguarding requirements in
OL,20,Fits most recent inspection.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
